{"id":"db558ef17df6892e","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-weakening.md","title":"Weakening","display":"df-weakening — Weakening","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-weakening","aliases":["72-df-weakening"],"display":"df-weakening — Weakening","depends_on":["[[72-df-sequence-sequent]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Chapter I, section 1.2.2, printed p.11, PDF p.23","source_statement_checked":true,"verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local typed rule-relation or compatibility-alias construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-weakening"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-weakening</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weakening — Weakening"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9f8d8c86ed32f12\" href=\"?note=c9f8d8c86ed32f12\" title=\"72-df-sequence-sequent\">72-df-sequence-sequent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter I, section 1.2.2, printed p.11, PDF p.23"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local typed rule-relation or compatibility-alias construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c9f8d8c86ed32f12\" href=\"?note=c9f8d8c86ed32f12\" title=\"72-df-sequence-sequent\">72-df-sequence-sequent</a> 的签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、公式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span>、有限序列上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、相继式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeqOrd}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{SeqOrd}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、串接、相继式箭头及一元实例编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in X_\\Sigma\">\\(A\\in X_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。下式以长度为1的前提序列与结论的有序对编码一元推理实例；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Weakening}_L,\\operatorname{Weakening}_R,\\operatorname{Weakening}\">\\(\\operatorname{Weakening}_L,\\operatorname{Weakening}_R,\\operatorname{Weakening}\\)</span> 只在这一固定签名内使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Weakening}_L\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma\\!\\left(\n\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma\\Delta,\n(\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma)\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma\\Delta\n\\right):\nA\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ \\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\n\\right\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Weakening}_L\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma\\!\\left(\n\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma\\Delta,\n(\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma)\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma\\Delta\n\\right):\nA\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ \\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\n\\right\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Weakening}_R\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma\\!\\left(\n\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma\\Delta,\n\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma(\\Delta\\frown\\langle A\\rangle)\n\\right):\nA\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ \\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\n\\right\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Weakening}_R\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma\\!\\left(\n\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma\\Delta,\n\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma(\\Delta\\frown\\langle A\\rangle)\n\\right):\nA\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ \\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\n\\right\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Weakening}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Weakening}_L\\cup\\operatorname{Weakening}_R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Weakening}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Weakening}_L\\cup\\operatorname{Weakening}_R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：第 I 章 §1.2.2，印刷 p.11 / PDF p.23。左弱化在左侧序列开头加入一次公式出现，右弱化在右侧序列末尾加入一次公式出现；前提均保持原来的两个上下文。输入为空上下文时仍产生良定义的一元序列。</p>\n<p>这是经典演算的推理实例关系；在线性逻辑中是否允许这样的实例，由所选演算的规则集另行决定。本定义不把弱化规则误写成相继式之间的材料蕴涵。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sequence-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"c9f8d8c86ed32f12","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequence-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequence-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"c9f8d8c86ed32f12","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-sequence-sequent]] 的签名 $\\Sigma$、公式集 $X_\\Sigma$、有限序列上下文 $\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma$、相继式集 $\\operatorname{SeqOrd}_\\Sigma$、串接、相继式箭头及一元实例编码 $\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SeqOrd}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Weakening}_L,\\operatorname{Weakening}_R,\\operatorname{Weakening}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Weakening}_L\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma\\!\\left(\n\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma\\Delta,\n(\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma)\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma\\Delta\n\\right):\nA\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ \\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\n\\right\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Weakening}_R\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma\\!\\left(\n\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma\\Delta,\n\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma(\\Delta\\frown\\langle A\\rangle)\n\\right):\nA\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ \\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\n\\right\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Weakening}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Weakening}_L\\cup\\operatorname{Weakening}_R.","display":true}],"bytes":2340,"backlinks":[{"id":"a1aa1a83a0327c18","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b016189a83874a0e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Weakening}_L$ and $\\operatorname{Weakening}_R$ are the two structural inference relations of [[72-df-weakening]]"},{"id":"07987a632b1cbf1a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-weakening|df-weakening — Weakening]]"}],"outgoing":["c9f8d8c86ed32f12"]}